<title>EGYPT: Egypt match 95/6 dividend 3.34 pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt match 95/6 dividend 3.34 pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nile Match and Prefabricated Housing raised net distributable profits for financial 1995/6 to 10.68 million pounds ($3.14 million) from 10.27 million in 1994/5, results published on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>The financial years end on June 30.</p>
<p>The firm said it would give a 3.34 pound dividend for each of its 2.0 million plus shares. The state privatised about 65 percent of Nile Match earlier this year.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.4 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 5783290/91</p>
